System configuration:

	Linux, with the SDL3 + Blend2D graphics backend of the icon-sdl
	fork (X11 or Wayland). This configuration is not part of
	upstream Icon; see README.md.

Latest Icon version:

	Version 9.5.25a of September 7, 2025

Installer:

	icon-sdl fork (github.com/phonologus/icon-sdl)

Missing features:

	See sdl/design.md.

Known bugs:

	None known

Comments:

	Install the packages in sdl/linux-packages.txt (Debian, Ubuntu;
	see README.md for others), then "make SDL-Configure
	name=linux-sdl", "make Icont" and "make Ilib". SDL3, Blend2D
	and AsmJit are built from the checksum-pinned sources in deps/;
	no network access is needed for the build.

